        "detailed_description": "<h1>Join us</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371510/extras/4a083347dd2383ed5defdd205c678022.avif?t=1772681037\" width=430 height=131 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >X: <strong>@CLLC_studio</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tiktok: <strong>roulettehero</strong></p></p><br><h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371510/extras/7e08017cffc5569974d38c43fb25fd14.avif?t=1772681037\" width=616 height=1748 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roulette Hero combines the mechanics of Luck Be A Landlord and Slay the Spire, and is a brand new form of deck-building roguelite strategy game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pull the lever, spin the roulette and trigger some killer combos! Each pull of the lever is full of surprises. Will you start a chain reaction, deal crushingly high damage, demolish your enemy and come out on top?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371510/extras/edf8dac0b5daf29407078fe5a2b08ad6.poster.avif?t=1772681037\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371510/extras/edf8dac0b5daf29407078fe5a2b08ad6.webm?t=1772681037\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371510/extras/edf8dac0b5daf29407078fe5a2b08ad6.mp4?t=1772681037\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Craft the Ultimate Synergy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your dream team of extraordinary animal companions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Position them wisely and combine their abilities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash devastating combos to wipe out the battlefield</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Every Spin is a New Adventure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple player character and swappable levers, all with unique special abilities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >13 animal types, 100+ animal tiles to arrange on your board</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ power-up cartridges to mix and match</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each spin could turn the tide... or send you scrambling for a comeback!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371510/extras/d29788d01ff7c2deb9ae91f9685256ce.poster.avif?t=1772681037\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371510/extras/d29788d01ff7c2deb9ae91f9685256ce.webm?t=1772681037\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371510/extras/d29788d01ff7c2deb9ae91f9685256ce.mp4?t=1772681037\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>See You at the Top, Challenger!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through all 20 difficulty levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete for the top spot on the leaderboard</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371510/extras/0b41f34fc03dddea4692eed084e7076d.avif?t=1772681037\" width=1560 height=876 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tinker Around in Steam Workshop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Subscribe to mods you're interested in</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add a new quirky character, thrilling power-up cartridge, or a crazy synergy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See where your imagination takes you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*There are currently playable mods on Steam Workshop</p>",
